&lt;p&gt;BS degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backend or infrastructure experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with C++, Java, or related structured programming language&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience working in environments including nontechnical team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with operations tooling, developer productivity, or developer tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;

a16z-waymo:greenhouse:7942779.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waymo is an autonomous driving technology company with the mission to be the world&#39;s most trusted driver. Since its start as the Google Self-Driving Car Project in 2009, Waymo has focused on building the Waymo Driver—The World&#39;s Most Experienced Driver™—to improve access to mobility while saving thousands of lives now lost to traffic crashes. The Waymo Driver powers Waymo’s fully autonomous ride-hail service and can also be applied to a range of vehicle platforms and product use cases. The Waymo Driver has provided over ten million rider-only trips, enabled by its experience autonomously driving over 100 million miles on public roads and tens of billions in simulation across 15+ U.S. states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Simulator team builds state-of-the-art simulations of realistic environments for the testing and training of the Waymo driver. We use machine learning to model the real world, including realistic agents (vehicles, pedestrians, cyclists, motorcyclists etc.), roads, traffic control systems, and weather. To increase the fidelity and steerability of the simulations, we employ large foundation models, trained on our massive datasets that allow us to quickly setup and rollout multiple scenarios to subject our driver to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are planning to set up a team in London UK to work with the teams in MTV and Oxford to build these foundation models out and to integrate them into several evaluation and training products. We are looking for research engineers to work on these exciting problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hybrid role, you will report to an Engineering Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a world class research engineering team to grow the state-of-the-art of ultra realistic AV simulations using foundation models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with teams in Waymo Oxford to use large models to improve sim realism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments that push the frontiers of AV simulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop metrics that measure the realism of simulated worlds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and evaluate large models and integrate them into the simulator and its downstream applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help hire outstanding research engineers from diverse backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a part of a collaborative research engineering team that takes research ideas and productionizes them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We prefer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in applied Deep Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years coding and design skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience solving complex production problems using state-of-the-art ML techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking research to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Data Analysis or Data Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The expected base salary range for this full-time position is listed below. Actual starting pay will be based on job-related factors, including exact work location, experience, relevant training and education, and skill level.&amp;nbsp; Waymo employees are also eligible to participate in Waymo’s discretionary annual bonus program, equity incentive plan, and generous Company benefits program, subject to eligibility requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£155,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£163,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-zipline:greenhouse:6488871003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Zipline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is the world’s largest and most experienced drone delivery service. We are on a mission to serve all humans equally by ensuring access to food, medicine and essential goods anytime, anywhere. We design, build, and operate the world’s largest autonomous logistics system, delivering critical supplies quickly and reliably. Today, Zipline operates on four continents, makes a delivery somewhere in the world every 30 seconds, and has completed millions of deliveries to date, including blood, vaccines, medical supplies, food, and retail products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers include the world’s largest and most prominent healthcare systems, governments, retailers, restaurants and global businesses who rely on us to save lives, reduce emissions, increase economic opportunity, and provide delivery from point A to point B as fast as possible. The drone is only 15% of what we’ve built to enable seamless, reliable, global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our system strengthens supply chains, reduces congestion, and gives people time back. With more than 140 million commercial autonomous miles safely flown, Zipline is redefining access to healthcare, consumer products, and food across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate at a global scale and are looking for practical problem solvers who thrive on real-world challenges and rapid growth. Our team is motivated by building systems that have a direct, meaningful impact on people’s lives and by scaling the future of logistics. We are seeking people who sculpt from first principles, enjoy facing adversity, and can do the impossible at record breaking speeds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You and The Role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Avionics team is a group of hardware and software experts responsible for designing robust systems that control our life-saving drone delivery service in some of the toughest environments on Earth. Our team designs aircraft avionics that must excel in a wide range of harsh, real-world climates and electromagnetic interference (EMI) environments. The Avionics system is a vital part of the overall zipline aircraft system architecture, where we strive to achieve high performance and reliability while minimizing mass and cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You and your team will be responsible for delivering high performance communication and &amp;nbsp;navigation systems that are tightly integrated into the Avionics flight computer. These radio systems are at the core of a new unmanned aerial system that will enable Zipline’s impact to expand from 100,000 deliveries/year to 100 million across the globe. &amp;nbsp;Zipline’s future success depends on the development of avionics systems that are low mass, low cost, high reliability, and produced at high volumes. Rigorous design engineering and validation is required, as well as ingenuity in approaches to packaging, integration, fault tolerance, and validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a leader with a strong foundation in RF system design and an excellent grasp of communication system design, RF electronics, and antenna design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a small but mighty team of RF engineers owning RF communications at Zipline. This includes Zip to Zip, Zip to Dock, Zip to Droid, and Zip to GA Aircraft. Today, we use tightly integrated 802.11, cellular, ADS-B, and GNSS radio systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement RF engineering processes to ensure high quality on tight, deterministic timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership in system level design spanning RF link budgets, interference analysis, and RF MAC layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, trade, revisit, and update vehicle RF architecture. Optimize at the integrated vehicle and fleet system levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design radios, amplifiers, filters, and antennas to meet RF architecture and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop confirmation tests, including functional, end of line, and system level tests to ensure the RF systems meet all the necessary specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate regulatory and industry certification for domestic and international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate within the Avionics and Ground Systems teams to implement the RF systems in the aircraft highly integrated flight computer as well as the Zip Dock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across teams such as GNC, Aero, and Perception to determine requirements for the RF system performance, identify trades, and ensure reliable operation for downstream systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing engineering to successfully sustain the operation of existing avionics systems in our existing fleet of thousands of aircraft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;section-wrapper page-full-width&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated skill building and leading a team of engineers to achieve ambitious goals, with proven success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-10 years of experience in RF engineering roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past success developing electronics for critical systems in fields such as automotive, aerospace, transportation, or medical devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep design experience in one or more of the following areas: RF system design and analysis, antenna design, or practical implementation of complex RF systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of communication system fundamentals including linear systems, signal processing, and communication theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RF design tools such as ADS, CST, Microwave Office, MATLAB, or Simulink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for collaborating in a fast paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to explain technical challenges and solutions to fellow engineers and non-engineers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors and/or Masters degree in Electrical Engineering, with focus on RF Comms and&amp;nbsp;Design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be eligible to work in the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work in person at Zipline’s South San Francisco office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;content-wrapper posting-page&quot;&gt;What Else You Need to Know&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;The starting cash range for this role is $XXX,XXX - $YYY,YYY. Please note that this is a target, starting cash range for a candidate who meets the minimum qualifications for this role. The final cash pay for this role will depend on a variety of factors, including a specific candidate&#39;s experience, qualifications, skills, working location, and projected impact. The total compensation package for this role may also include: equity compensation; discretionary annual or performance bonuses; sales incentives; benefits such as medical, dental and vision insurance; paid time off; and more. &amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:13057,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Barlow&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:12}&quot;&gt;The starting cash range for this role is $160,000 - $200,000. Please note that this is a target, starting cash range for a candidate who meets the minimum qualifications for this role. The final cash pay for this role will depend on a variety of factors, including a specific candidate&#39;s experience, qualifications, skills, working location, and projected impact. The total compensation package for this role may also include: equity compensation; discretionary annual or performance bonuses; sales incentives; benefits such as medical, dental and vision insurance; paid time off; and more.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Zipline is an equal opportunity employer and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, mental or physical disability, medical condition, genetic information, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, and related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, military or veteran status, citizenship, or other characteristics protected by state, federal or local law or our other policies.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We value diversity at Zipline and welcome applications from those who are traditionally underrepresented in tech. If you like the sound of this position but are not sure if you are the perfect fit, please apply!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-zipline:greenhouse:7628559003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Zipline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is the world’s largest and most experienced drone delivery service. We are on a mission to serve all humans equally by ensuring access to food, medicine and essential goods anytime, anywhere. We design, build, and operate the world’s largest autonomous logistics system, delivering critical supplies quickly and reliably. Today, Zipline operates on four continents, makes a delivery somewhere in the world every 30 seconds, and has completed millions of deliveries to date, including blood, vaccines, medical supplies, food, and retail products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers include the world’s largest and most prominent healthcare systems, governments, retailers, restaurants and global businesses who rely on us to save lives, reduce emissions, increase economic opportunity, and provide delivery from point A to point B as fast as possible. The drone is only 15% of what we’ve built to enable seamless, reliable, global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our system strengthens supply chains, reduces congestion, and gives people time back. With more than 140 million commercial autonomous miles safely flown, Zipline is redefining access to healthcare, consumer products, and food across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate at a global scale and are looking for practical problem solvers who thrive on real-world challenges and rapid growth. Our team is motivated by building systems that have a direct, meaningful impact on people’s lives and by scaling the future of logistics. We are seeking people who sculpt from first principles, enjoy facing adversity, and can do the impossible at record breaking speeds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ground System Deployments team is looking for an innovative, collaborative and self-driven Civil Project Engineer to join the team to ensure the successful deployment of Zipline’s Ground Systems in all possible applications and configurations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is well suited to seasoned civil engineers looking to apply their experience designing novel and innovative sites, foundations and structures to advance and accelerate the new and growing industry of&amp;nbsp; autonomous drone delivery ground systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With broad scope to influence the design of current and next generation systems this role will jopin a stellar team responsible for the site level designs, layouts, civil designs, structural and foundation designs and implementation. Interacting with various mechanical, structural and electrical engineering stakeholders across the organization this role will&amp;nbsp; ensure the overall system and its site design work hand in hand to ensure the successful deployment of Ziplines Ground Systems within cost and timeline goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a mandate to drive positive change through the organization - as problems or scenarios occur this individual will be tasked with both 0 to 1 problem/project responsibility and also working with the broad engineering and deployments organization to implement foundation changes to product and process as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position can be based out of our San Francisco, Dallas or Houston Offices. Onsite is preferred, but this role can be remote flexible with up to 50% travel for the right candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the Civil Engineer of Record for Zipline projects in Texas and other jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, refine and update civil layouts for the sites. Act as the Zipline representative for any technical clarifications from cities or jurisdictions regarding our designs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the civil and site design standards of Zipline sites.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the pavement, drainage, and sitescape designs and approaches of Zipline sites and structures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on permitting, codes and and other certification efforts relevant to the projects and structures.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and interact with cities and relevant inspectors or relevant external parties to ensure timely project approvals and deployment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure relevant and applicable civil strategies are investigated and implemented where appropriate - grading designs, curb designs, pavement designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand our internal and external customer’s business and needs and work with our internal engineering and business teams to refine and roadmap necessary changes to ensure the successful deployment of the Ground Systems infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and develop relationships with outside organizations (local jurisdiction, utilities, contractors, OEM and material suppliers etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate all options and a lean budget, select best vendors to ensure reliable and quality services and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and mitigate the preconstruction, construction, operational and sustaining&amp;nbsp; risks associated with each project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact directly with internal and external partners and stakeholders as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domestic travel to project sites expected on an ad-hoc basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Civil Professional Engineering qualification with stamping capacity in Texas (or the ability to quickly obtain stamping capacity in Texas). Ability to stamp in Arizona and other sunbelt states a strong preference, or the ability and capacity to quickly gain this qualification.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher&amp;nbsp; with minimum 6 years of experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The individual should have an Engineering background (Civil, others acceptable with relevant experience and stamping capacity) and have worked in the construction, electrical design/EPC, or renewable energy industry, or equivalent industries for 4+ years. The individual should have experience (4yrs+) in working with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Civil codes and building standards, and applicable design and management software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Product Management, Technical Program Management or applicable areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems engineering and&amp;nbsp; system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;External design teams (Architectural, Structural, Civil,Electrical MEPs) on commercial or industrial development&amp;nbsp; / construction projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated logistics, UAV aviation, EVSE Charging, Renewable Energy and Battery Energy Storage Systems or equivalent industries a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong candidates should have excellent communications skills to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive internal alignment of requirements for projects based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership team with updates on scope, schedule and budgets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive external parties for the implementation of real estate projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be eligible to work in the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Else You Need To Know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is an equal opportunity employer and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws or our own sensibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diversity at Zipline and welcome applications from those who are traditionally underrepresented in tech. If you like the sound of this position but are not sure if you are the perfect fit, please apply!&lt;/p&gt;

a16z-zipline:greenhouse:7777059003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Zipline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is the world’s largest and most experienced drone delivery service. We are on a mission to serve all humans equally by ensuring access to food, medicine and essential goods anytime, anywhere. We design, build, and operate the world’s largest autonomous logistics system, delivering critical supplies quickly and reliably. Today, Zipline operates on four continents, makes a delivery somewhere in the world every 30 seconds, and has completed millions of deliveries to date, including blood, vaccines, medical supplies, food, and retail products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers include the world’s largest and most prominent healthcare systems, governments, retailers, restaurants and global businesses who rely on us to save lives, reduce emissions, increase economic opportunity, and provide delivery from point A to point B as fast as possible. The drone is only 15% of what we’ve built to enable seamless, reliable, global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our system strengthens supply chains, reduces congestion, and gives people time back. With more than 140 million commercial autonomous miles safely flown, Zipline is redefining access to healthcare, consumer products, and food across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate at a global scale and are looking for practical problem solvers who thrive on real-world challenges and rapid growth. Our team is motivated by building systems that have a direct, meaningful impact on people’s lives and by scaling the future of logistics. We are seeking people who sculpt from first principles, enjoy facing adversity, and can do the impossible at record breaking speeds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is building the world&#39;s first instant logistics system, using autonomy, robotics, and advanced manufacturing to transform how goods move around the globe. As we continue to scale across multiple countries, business units, and talent markets, we&#39;re looking for a Staff Compensation Manager to help shape how we attract, reward, and retain exceptional talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into the Head of People Ops, this role will lead the development of compensation strategies that support Zipline&#39;s growth while balancing market competitiveness, internal equity, and long-term business objectives. You&#39;ll partner closely with leaders across People, Recruiting, Finance, and the business to guide compensation decisions, improve programs and processes, and provide data-driven insights that influence workforce strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly strategic individual contributor role for someone who enjoys solving complex problems, building scalable systems, and influencing decisions at the highest levels of the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve Zipline&#39;s compensation philosophy, frameworks, and governance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead compensation strategy and decision-making for senior leaders and executive-level roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Recruiting on competitive offer strategies across technical, manufacturing, operations, and business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain market-pricing methodologies that support global hiring and workforce expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct compensation analyses and modeling to inform pay decisions, retention strategies, and workforce planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise leaders on promotions, leveling, organizational changes, and other compensation-related decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable tools, guidelines, and processes that improve consistency and efficiency across compensation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market trends, emerging pay practices, and competitive talent landscapes to inform future strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Finance, People Business Partners, People Operations, and HR systems teams to ensure operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of Zipline&#39;s broader Total Rewards strategy, including equity, benefits, and recognition programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of compensation experience, including ownership of complex compensation programs and senior-level compensation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of compensation strategy, market benchmarking, job architecture, and pay governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in high-growth technology, aerospace, manufacturing, logistics, or similarly complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical and modeling skills with the ability to translate data into business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success influencing stakeholders and driving decisions across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable processes and operating models in fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment, attention to detail, and ability to manage sensitive information with discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, including the ability to present recommendations to senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Human Resources, Business, Finance, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified Compensation Professional (CCP) Certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or leading compensation globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with private-company equity programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Else You Need to Know&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting cash range for this role is $150,000 - $230,000. Please note that this is a target, starting cash range for a candidate who meets the minimum qualifications for this role. The final cash pay for this role will depend on a variety of factors, including a specific candidate&#39;s experience, qualifications, skills, working location, and projected impact. The total compensation package for this role may also include: equity compensation; overtime pay; discretionary annual or performance bonuses; sales incentives; benefits such as medical, dental and vision insurance; paid time off; and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipline is an equal opportunity employer and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, mental or physical disability, medical condition, genetic information, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, and related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, military or veteran status, citizenship, or other characteristics protected by state, federal or local law or our other policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diversity at Zipline and welcome applications from those who are traditionally underrepresented in tech. If you like the sound of this position but are not sure if you are the perfect fit, please apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please Note&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have received reports stating that certain individuals are reaching out to people under false pretenses, claiming to be Zipline employees, affiliates, agents, or representatives. They may seek to gain access to your personal information or to acquire money from you by offering fictitious employment opportunities or by claiming that they are contacting you on Zipline’s behalf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genuine Zipline employees or representatives will never ask you for money or payment in exchange for employment opportunities or other related services. Any such offer of employment or any other service in exchange for fees that claims to be from us is deceitful and part of a fraud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

abstractvc-garner-health:greenhouse:6001.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Garner’s mission is to transform the healthcare economy, delivering high-quality and affordable care for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are fundamentally reimagining how healthcare works in the U.S. by partnering with employers to redesign healthcare benefits using clear incentives and powerful, data-driven insights. Our approach guides employees to higher-quality, lower-cost care, creating a system that works better for everyone. Patients achieve better health outcomes, employers spend healthcare dollars more effectively, and physicians are rewarded for delivering exceptional care rather than performing more procedures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Garner is one of the fastest-growing healthcare technology companies in the country. Our products are trusted by the most sophisticated employers and providers in the industry, and we are building a team of talented, mission-driven individuals who are motivated to make a meaningful impact on healthcare at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an execution-focused and visionary Data Engineering Manager to lead our Data Platform Team. In this critical role, you will manage a team of talented engineers dedicated to building the common, reusable abstractions and high-throughput data infrastructure that power Garner’s internal and external applications. You will champion an AI-native development philosophy and scale our data pipeline capabilities, ensuring our systems seamlessly support the heavy computational demands of our next phase of company-wide growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in our New York City office (in the Financial District). You must be willing to work in the office 3 days per week on Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage the Data Platform Engineering team, owning the end-to-end design, implementation, and operational excellence of systems that process complex healthcare data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide high-quality technical contributions and architectural guidance, establishing robust standards for data modeling, processing, and system maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize common data abstractions, pipelines, and frameworks designed for high scalability, ensuring our platform keeps pace with exponential enterprise data growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex, ambiguous business and data requirements into well-scoped, accurately estimated, and composable architectural pieces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster and drive an AI-native engineering culture within the team, integrating cutting-edge AI tools and integrations to enhance development workflows and automate data operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow stakeholder relationships across Engineering and Product, aligning team priorities with departmental OKRs and broader business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, coach, and guide your team members, conducting detailed design reviews and managing robust Root Cause Analyses (RCA) to continuously elevate technical rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on engineering experience, with a focus on Big Data and distributed system and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of managing engineering teams, with a track record of building and mentoring high performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with batch data processing frameworks such as Hadoop, Spark, EMR, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with stream processing systems such as Kafka and RedPanda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with technologies such as Temporal, Apache iceberg, AWS glue, Spark, DBT, and Soda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibits strong ownership and a proactive mindset, with a proven ability to translate complex business needs into scalable, actionable technical roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate effectively in dynamic, fast-paced startup environments, with a hands-on approach and a strong commitment to organizational success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for managing healthcare data standards (e.g. HIPAA, EDI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to be a part of our mission to improve the U.S. healthcare system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to be a part of a high-performing, mission-driven team that operates with intense urgency, a strong sense of individual accountability, and a commitment to authentic feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies we use:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, Spark, dbt, SnowFlake, Iceberg, Airflow, OpenMetadata, Kubernetes, NATS, AWS, Terraform, Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join a fast-growing company in a transformative role, helping shape the future of healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The target salary range for this position is $310,000 - $385,000. Individual compensation for this role will depend on various factors, including qualifications, skills, and applicable laws. In addition to base compensation, this role is eligible to participate in our equity incentive and competitive benefits plans, including but not limited to: flexible PTO, Medical/Dental/Vision plan options, 401(k), Teladoc Health and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud and Security Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of recent job scam attempts. Our recruiters use &lt;a href=&quot;http://getgarner.com/&quot;&gt;getgarner.com&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;garnerhealth.com&quot;&gt;garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt; email domains exclusively. If you have been contacted by someone claiming to be a Garner recruiter or a hiring manager from a different domain about a potential job, please report it to law enforcement &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ic3.gov/Home/ComplaintChoice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidateprotection@getgarner.com&quot;&gt;candidateprotection@garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
Garner Health is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and values diversity in the workplace. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.
&lt;p&gt;Garner Health is committed to providing accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our recruiting process. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@getgarner.com&quot;&gt;talent@garnerhealth.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

abstractvc-polychain-capital:greenhouse:.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;Polychain is seeking a Backend Engineer to support our Accounting and Reporting Systems. This contract role is essential to building APIs, managing crypto asset data, and delivering actionable insights for our asset operations team. You’ll focus on data extraction from various crypto platforms, data normalization, and optimizing data accessibility for portfolio management, smart contract vesting, and counterparty exposure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;A&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;PI Development and Integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain APIs to extract crypto asset data from counterparties and block explorers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high reliability, performance, and security across all data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize no-code tools like Retool to build internal dashboards and data interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Data Management and Normalization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Normalize raw data to ensure accuracy and consistency across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement scalable data storage and retrieval solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Query and Reporting Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and optimize complex SQL and NoSQL queries to support robust reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data is easily queryable for portfolio insights and operations analysis.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams across asset operations, finance, and investments to understand data needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and reports that provide visibility into smart contract vesting schedules, counterparty exposures, and portfolio positions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Documentation and Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation for APIs, data models, and reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with data protection and processing standards.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Data Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in backend engineering roles.&lt;br&gt;Strong expertise in SQL and relational databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and managing APIs.&lt;br&gt;Familiarity with blockchain technologies, smart contracts, and decentralized finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build backend-powered data visualizations and reporting interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful and solutions-oriented; comfortable in fast-paced, ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for cryptocurrency and blockchain technology.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud (BigTable) or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in the crypto/blockchain industry.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive Compensation:&amp;nbsp; $150/hour (dependent on experience).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Polychain is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; employer.&amp;nbsp;Polychain does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy, sex, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, citizenship, or any other basis protected by applicable local, state or federal law.&amp;nbsp;We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

adventinternational-definitive-healthcar.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;About &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Definitive Healthcare&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Definitive Healthcare (NASDAQ: DH), we’re passionate about turning data, analytics, and expertise into meaningful intelligence that helps our customers achieve success and shape the future of healthcare. We empower them to uncover the right markets, opportunities, and people—paving the way for smarter decisions and greater impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Headquartered just outside of Boston, Massachusetts, Definitive Healthcare operates across North America, Europe, and India, supporting a growing global client base of more than 2,400 customers since our founding in 2011.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re also a great place to work. &lt;/span&gt;In 2024 and 2025, we earned multiple workplace honors, including Built In’s 100 Best Places to Work in Boston (both years), a Stevie Bronze Award for Great Employers, and recognition as a Great Place to Work in India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We foster a collaborative, inclusive culture where diverse perspectives drive innovation. Through programs like DefinitiveCares and our employee-led affinity groups we strive to promote connection, education, and inclusion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director, Account Management, you will be responsible for the leadership, hiring, development, and performance of a team of quota carrying sales professionals focused on growing our existing clients. You will work closely with team members to identify opportunities for growth within accounts, renew existing contracts, and help close business. Success for this position will be measured in terms of quota attainment, retention, and growth within accounts This is a hands-on position that requires both sales coaching as well as rolling up the sleeves to personally get involved with closing the larger deals. The ideal candidate will be expected to consistently deliver exceptional sales results, operate with a growth mindset, consider both the short-term as well as the bigger picture and create a winning and positive team environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:281,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed monthly, quarterly, and annual team revenue quotas and KPI targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a metrics-based culture of excellence; focused on activity, accountability and achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly assist in all phases of the sales process including prospecting, value proposition, product demonstration, follow-up and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, train, and develop new team members to achieve their full potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a fun and positive high performance work environment that celebrates success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, mentor, and instill leadership and management best practices throughout the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying training needs and assist in the creation and deployment of effective training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of inside sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of front-line sales management experience and a process-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to be successful in a high velocity sales environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to be hands on and an active participant in prospecting for upsell opportunities, contract renewals and closing business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of consistent overachievement, both as an individual contributor and manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for developing team members and teaching a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, high energy with a commitment to sustained excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work and lead teams dynamically in both an in-office setting as well as remote settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SalesForce.com preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The salary range for this position is $144,000.00 - $270,000.00 per year, which represents the base pay the company reasonably and in good faith expects to pay for this role. Actual pay within this range will be determined based on factors such as relevant experience, skills, and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the position, employees may also be eligible to participate in a company bonus or commission plan. All employees are eligible for a comprehensive benefits package, including medical, dental, and vision coverage, unlimited paid time off, and participation in the company’s 401(k) plan with employer contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we love Definitive, and why you will too!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry leading products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hard, and have fun doing it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incredibly fast growth means limitless opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and dynamic culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside some of the most talented and dedicated teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definitive Cares, our community service group, gives all of us a chance to give back&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits package including great healthcare benefits and a 401(k) match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What our Employees are saying about us on Glassdoor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;“Great Work atmosphere, great work life balance, excellent company to work for, amazing top notch product, incredible customer service, lots of tools to help you succeed.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;-Business Development Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Great team. Amazing growth. Employees are treated very well.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;-Research Analyst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“I have waited 36 years to work at a dream job for a dream company and I am so happy to have finally got there.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;-Profile Analyst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you don’t fit all of these qualifications, but believe you’re still a great fit, feel free to apply and tell us why in your cover letter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you are a California, Colorado, New York City or Washington resident and this role is a remote role, you can receive additional information about the compensation and benefits for this role, which we will provide upon request.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Definitive Hiring Philosophy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Definitive Healthcare is an equal opportunity employer that celebrates diversity and is committed to creating an inclusive workplace with equal opportunity for all applicants and teammates. Our goal is to recruit the most talented people from a diverse candidate pool regardless of race, color, religion, age, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation or any other status. If you’re interested in working in a fast growing, exciting working environment – we encourage you to apply!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your privacy is important to us. Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.definitivehc.com/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; which tells you how we use and process your personal information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider cld cle c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t clf clg w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; All communications regarding the hiring process at Definitive Healthcare will come directly from one of our corporate recruiters or coordinators using an @definitivehc.com email address. We do not advertise open roles on Facebook and will never request money transfers or ask candidates to purchase equipment with a promise of reimbursement. If you receive any suspicious communication, please contact &lt;a id=&quot;menurrn7&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;mailto:careers@definitivehc.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@definitivehc.com&lt;/a&gt; to verify your status in the application process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:3937538.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 이커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 이커머스 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 유지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는 여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;쿠팡의 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;리테일 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;비즈니스 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;우리는 주어진 역할을 넘어 과감한 실행력을 지향합니다. 쿠팡 리테일은 로켓배송의 압도적인 성장을 실질적인 비즈니스 성과로 창출해 나가고 있는 핵심 조직입니다. 쿠팡 리테일에서는 카테고리 전략과 수익구조를 직접 설계하며 유통 산업의 새로운 표준을 정립합니다. &amp;nbsp;데이터와 고객 중심 사고로 성장을 견인할 시니어/리드급 인재에게 쿠팡은 커리어 확장의 최고 무대가 될 것입니다. 정해진 답을 따르기 보다 과감한 시도로 성과를 증명해 온 분이라면, 로켓배송과 함께 그 가치를 더 크게 키워 보시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;로켓 배송 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;로켓배송은 세계적 수준의 압도적인 기술과 물류 인프라를 바탕으로 오늘 주문하면 내일 도착하는 쿠팡의 핵심 서비스입니다. 상품의 직접 매입부터 보관, 배송, 반품까지 전 과정을 쿠팡이 책임지는 End-to-End 방식입니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;* 로켓배송 Brand Manager 소개 영상 : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zLqPPeoiivw&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[인터뷰] 쿠팡 BM을 만나다&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;카테고리 전략 수립 및 브랜드 발굴·성장 관리&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;: 시장과 고객 데이터를 활용하여 카테고리의 중장기 전략을 수립하고, 이를 기반으로 잠재력 있는 브랜드를 발굴하고 입점시킵니다. 브랜드와의 동반 성장하며 로켓배송의 성장 기반을 확보합니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;브랜드 파트너십 구축 및 비즈니스 구조 설계&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;: 브랜드사와의 협업을 통하여 로켓배송의 상품들을 직매입합니다. 브랜드사와 함께 마케팅 조건을 설계하고, 상호 성장을 할 수 있도록 파트너십을 운영합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;카테고리 성과(P&amp;amp;L) 관리 및 상품·프로모션 전략 수립&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;: 매출·수익 등 핵심 지표를 관리하고, 이를 기반으로 상품과 프로모션 전략을 수립합니다. &amp;nbsp;시장에서 경쟁력 있는 가격을 트래킹하고, 공급가 협의를 통하여 성장을 이끕니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;운영 프로세스 총괄 관리&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;: 업체의 니즈와 운영 기준 사이가 균형있도록 조율하고, 상품 등록, 재고 운영, 가격 정책, 프로모션 실행 등 운영의 전반을 체계적으로 관리합니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;운영 프로세스 개선 및 유관 부서 협업&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;: 마케팅·물류·카탈로그 운영 등 유관 부서와의 협업을 통하여 근본 원인 분석하고 및 개선을 실행합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;유관 경력 7년 이상으로, 온라인 리테일 비즈니스에 관심이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이커머스 플랫폼 및 직매입에 대한 이해가 있으신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;유연한 사고로 변화를 수용하고 긍정적 에너지를 팀의 몰입을 이끄는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;분석과 인사이트를 통해 실제 서비스·매출 지표를 개선한 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대 요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;빠른 의사결정과 실행으로 가시적인 성과를 만들어낸 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;성과를 KPI로 정의하고 수치로 증명한 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;예상치 못한 문제 앞에서도 해결책을 찾아내고 끝까지 실행하는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비즈니스 성장을 위해 스스로 할 일을 찾아서 확장하는 주도성을 가진 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;** 상세 이력과 업무 성과가 기재된 한글 이력서 1부를 필수적으로 제출하셔야 합니다.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및 안내 사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 하이어링매니저면접 - 화상면접 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 절차는 직무 별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별안내드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고 사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;취업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;보호&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;대상자&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;보훈대상자&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;장애인&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;등&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;관련&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;법률에&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;따라&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;채용우대를&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;받을&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;수&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;KO&quot;&gt;있습니다&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반 사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;고용형태는 정규직으로 수습기간&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;12&lt;/span&gt;주를 포함합니다&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;단&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류 반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』 제11조 제6항에 따른 것입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위 2항 본문에 따라 채용서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용서류 반환청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제3호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (recruitingops@coupang.com)로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위 2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;단&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;위&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/span&gt;항 내지&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4&lt;/span&gt;항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7865363.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Coupang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Growth Marketing (GM) organization drives sustainable and efficient customer acquisition, conversion, retention, and growth across Coupang. Within GM, the Growth Product &amp;amp; Machine Intelligence team leads product strategy and execution, supported by dedicated AI/ML/Core Engineering, Data Science, and Analytics teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a strategic and execution-focused product leader to join our Onsite Growth Product team. In this role, you will be a key pillar of the team, owning critical initiatives across landing experiences, campaign management, and personalization. You will partner with AI/ML engineering, UX design, and marketing leaders to deliver a best-in-class onsite experience, leveraging AI-driven innovation to optimize conversion for all incoming traffic through a horizontal platform that powers high-performing, personalized customer journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the product vision for ML-powered landing page experiences, including personalized recommendations and contextual UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end product development, from ideation through launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive conversion uplift through experimentation, reinforcement learning, and rapid feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with marketing and design teams to ensure generated content aligns with brand guidelines and performance goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor industry trends and emerging technologies to inform product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own metrics such as GMV uplift, buyer conversion, and engagement, ensuring measurable impact at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, AI/ML, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product management experience, including 3+ years in AI/ML, AdTech or Onsite Growth domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving measurable business impact (conversion, GMV) through product innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with expertise in experimentation frameworks and causal inference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and leadership skills, with the ability to influence across functions and levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a bias for action and passion for innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process and Others&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - 1st Virtual Interview - 2nd Virtual Interview - Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details to Consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are proud to offer equal opportunities for all applicants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring may be restricted in case the legal qualifications required for hiring and work performance is not met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a full-time regular position and includes 12 weeks of probation period; provided, however, the probationary period may be either skipped, shortened or extended if necessary for business purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice is located below.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document Return Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This notification is given pursuant to Article 11 (6) of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant, who has applied but not been finally selected for a position at Coupang (the “Company”), may request the Company to return his/her hiring documents submitted pursuant to the Fair Hiring Procedure Act. However, this will not apply where the hiring documents were submitted via the website of the Company or e-mail, or where the job applicant submitted those documents voluntarily without a request from the Company. In addition, if the hiring documents were destroyed due to a natural disaster or any other reasons not attributable to the Company, such documents will be deemed to have been returned to the job applicant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A job applicant who wishes to request the return of his/her hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above should fill out a “Request for Return of Hiring Documents” [Annex Form No. 3 in the Enforcement Rule of the Fair Hiring Procedure Act] and submit It by email (recruitingops@coupangpay.com). In such case, within fourteen (14) days from the date of identifying the receipt of the request, the Company will send the hiring documents to the job applicant’s designated address via registered mail. Please be informed that the job applicant is required to pay the postage on the registered mail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In preparation for a job applicant’s request for the return of hiring documents pursuant to the main sentence of paragraph 2 above, the Company shall retain the original hiring documents submitted by the job applicant for 180 days from the completion of the recruiting process. If no request is made until the end of this period, all his/her hiring documents will be destroyed immediately in accordance with the Personal Information Protection Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The above paragraphs 1 - 4 shall only apply when the labor-related laws of Korea govern the application. They are otherwise not applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7916568.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;회사 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 리테일 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 유지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;직무 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;쿠팡의 가전&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; A/S &lt;/span&gt;전담 센터&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;(CS Handyman)&lt;/span&gt;은 쿠팡에서 구매한 가전 제품에 대한&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; A/S&lt;/span&gt;를 제공하기 위해 쿠팡 고유의 서비스 철학을 담은 차별화된&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; A/S &lt;/span&gt;전담 고객센터를 운영합니다&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;운영과 관련된 정기적인 보고&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;상담 지식 및 교육 자료 제작&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;서비스 과정 중에 발견되는 시스템&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;프로세스와 관련한 이슈 사항들에 대해 개선안을 제안합니다&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;이를 위해 고객 경험에 대한 끊임없는&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; Deep Dive&lt;/span&gt;를 통해 문제를 정의하고 분석하며 솔루션을 제안해 구매에서&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; A/S&lt;/span&gt;까지 전반적인 경험과 서비스 프로세스 고도화에 기여합니다&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;업무 내용&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
