&lt;p&gt;The team owns a new product layer within the Platform organization. Its scope spans the customer-facing surfaces where enterprises engage with the broader Claude ecosystem, the partner-facing surfaces that support companies building on Anthropic&#39;s platform, and the workflows and orchestration that sit between them. The team builds on top of identity, tenancy, authorization, and billing primitives owned by other platform teams rather than rebuilding them — a meaningful part of the role is making those seams clean and durable as the product grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form the team - hire the founding engineers, set the technical direction, and establish how the team operates&lt;/li&gt;
