&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is currently seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Therapist Assistant, PTA, &lt;/strong&gt;for a &lt;strong&gt;full-time or &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;part-time&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity performing visits for our&lt;strong&gt; Senior living office in WIlliston, Vermont&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;This office services adult and geriatric patients on a per visit basis in territories throughout &lt;strong&gt;Franklin County, Vermont.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0.0001pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
