&lt;p&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behavioral Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detail-oriented with a strong focus on &lt;strong&gt;data accuracy and quality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive, ownership-driven mindset with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;automation tools or scripting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
